{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And afterward they came, etc.</b> Meaning, after the people believed. And these too are the words of HaShem, as it is written (Exodus 3:18): ״וְשָׁמְעוּ לְקוֹלֶךָ״ and afterward ״וּבָאתָ״ etc., and therefore He inserted a break before ״וְשָׁמְעוּ לְקוֹלֶךָ״, even though it is the conclusion of the matter concerning Israel, and it is joined with ״וּבָאתָ״ etc. — understand:"], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:24:40.752287448Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}